  "notes": [
    "The first keeper attempt at the ratio-floor top-up FAILED on chain: tx 0x1002b8e119c9d86d7bb25f1f70337a892ef9aa0c059eab68e584e43a8b1d2e60 (block 16612677) ran out of gas at a limit of 25,584. The node's eth_estimateGas answered about 21,300 for execute(), while the call needs about 5.6M. No funds moved and the reserve was untouched. The keeper now never sends under a 6M gas floor (the unused part of a limit is not charged), and the successful attempt below is the retry.",
